  "title": "The Commandments — Repent, Believe, Follow",
  "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"2.5rem\",\"bottom\":\"4rem\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4rem\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#b3261e\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#b3261e\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\",\"fontSize\":\"2.6rem\"}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#b3261e;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:2.6rem\">Repent, Believe, Follow</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"/instructions/\">Read Instructions</a> · <a href=\"/instructions/instructions-index/\">Instructions index</a> · <a href=\"/instructions/beyond-the-torah/\">Beyond the Torah</a> · <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/individual-command-counting-method/\">Counting and classification guide</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This page preserves the numbered Christ studies and their quoted passages. <a href=\"/instructions/repent-believe-follow/\">Open the complementary Harmony study</a>. The two views serve different purposes; their entry counts are not added together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Verified Saints Translation links.</strong> Biblical references open the Saints chapter at its exact verse anchor. Saints numbering appears first; corresponding KJV numbers are shown where they differ. Ranges open at their first verse. <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/#citation-audit\">Read the citation and numbering notes</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"saints-pericope\"} -->\n<p class=\"saints-pericope\">The Commandments of Christ · His own commandments: the call · 29–45</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-the-law-fulfilled/\">← The Law Fulfilled</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/#part-two\">The Commandments of Christ: all subjects</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-love-mercy-forgiveness/\">Love, Mercy and Forgiveness →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"17px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#3e3e3e;font-size:17px\">The first words of His preaching and the conditions of discipleship: to turn, to believe, to follow, and to keep what He commands.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"16px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#3e3e3e;font-size:16px\"><strong>On this page:</strong> <a href=\"#t2-1\">Repent and Believe</a> · <a href=\"#t2-2\">Follow Me</a> · <a href=\"#t2-3\">Hear and Keep</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"saints-section\",\"anchor\":\"t2-1\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading saints-section\" id=\"t2-1\">Repent and Believe</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k29\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k29\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>29.</strong> To repent, for the kingdom of the heavens has drawn near.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From then on Jesus began to proclaim, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Repent, for the kingdom of the heavens has drawn near.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-4/#v4-17\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 4:17\">Matthew 4:17</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-1/#v1-15\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 1:15\">Mark 1:15</a><br><strong>In the Law:</strong> <a href=\"/instructions/#study-102\">102. Confession and restitution after wronging someone</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k30\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k30\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>30.</strong> To believe in the good news.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>and saying, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“The appointed time is fulfilled, and the kingdom of God has drawn near; repent, and believe in the gospel.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-1/#v1-15\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 1:15\">Mark 1:15</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k31\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k31\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>31.</strong> This is the work of God: to believe in the One He sent.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Jesus answered them, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“This is the work of God: that you believe in the One He sent.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-6/#v6-29\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 6:29\">John 6:29</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-14/#v14-1\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 14:1\">John 14:1</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-12/#v12-36\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 12:36\">John 12:36</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k32\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k32\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>32.</strong> You must be born from above, of water and Spirit.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Jesus answered, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Amen, amen, I tell you: unless someone is born from water and Spirit, he cannot enter the kingdom of God.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">What is born from the flesh is flesh, and what is born from the Spirit is spirit.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Do not marvel that I said to you, ‘You all must be born from above.’</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-3/#v3-5\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 3:5–7\">John 3:5–7</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-3/#v3-3\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 3:3\">John 3:3</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k33\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k33\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>33.</strong> To become like children, or you will not enter the kingdom of the heavens.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>and said, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Truly I tell you, unless you turn and become like children, you will certainly not enter the kingdom of the heavens.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Therefore whoever humbles himself like this child is greatest in the kingdom of the heavens.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-18/#v18-3\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 18:3–4\">Matthew 18:3–4</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-10/#v10-15\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 10:15\">Mark 10:15</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-18/#v18-17\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 18:17\">Luke 18:17</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k34\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k34\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>34.</strong> To enter through the narrow gate.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Enter through the narrow gate, because the gate is wide and the road broad that leads to destruction, and many enter through it.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">How narrow is the gate and how constricted the road that leads to life, and few find it!</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-7/#v7-13\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 7:13–14\">Matthew 7:13–14</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-13/#v13-24\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 13:24\">Luke 13:24</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"saints-section\",\"anchor\":\"t2-2\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading saints-section\" id=\"t2-2\">Follow Me</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k35\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k35\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>35.</strong> To come after Him.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He said to them, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Come after Me, and I will make you fishers of people.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-4/#v4-19\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 4:19\">Matthew 4:19</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-1/#v1-17\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 1:17\">Mark 1:17</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-9/#v9-9\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 9:9\">Matthew 9:9</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-1/#v1-43\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 1:43\">John 1:43</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-21/#v21-22\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 21:22\">John 21:22</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k36\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k36\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>36.</strong> To deny yourself, take up your cross, and follow Him.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Then Jesus said to His disciples, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“If anyone wishes to come after Me, let him deny himself, take up his cross, and follow Me.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">For whoever wishes to save his life will lose it, but whoever loses his life because of Me will find it.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-16/#v16-24\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 16:24–25\">Matthew 16:24–25</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-8/#v8-34\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 8:34–35\">Mark 8:34–35</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-9/#v9-23\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 9:23–24\">Luke 9:23–24</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-10/#v10-38\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 10:38–39\">Matthew 10:38–39</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k37\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k37\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>37.</strong> To come to Him, take His yoke, and learn from Him.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Come to Me, all you who labour and are burdened, and I will give you rest.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Take My yoke upon you, and learn from Me; for I am meek and lowly in heart, and you shall find rest for your souls.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">For My yoke is easy, and My burden is light.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-11/#v11-28\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 11:28–30\">Matthew 11:28–30</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k38\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k38\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>38.</strong> To let the dead bury their own dead, and not to look back from the plow.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He said to him, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Let the dead bury their own dead; but you go and proclaim God’s kingdom.”</mark> Another also said, “I will follow Thee, Lord; but first permit me to say farewell to those in my house.” Jesus said to him, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“No one who puts his hand to a plow and looks backward is fit for God’s kingdom.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-9/#v9-60\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 9:60–62\">Luke 9:60–62</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-8/#v8-22\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 8:22\">Matthew 8:22</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k39\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k39\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>39.</strong> To count the cost: whoever does not renounce all that he has cannot be His disciple.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“If anyone comes to Me and does not hate his own father and mother and wife and children and brothers and sisters, and even his own life, he cannot be My disciple.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Whoever does not carry his own cross and come after Me cannot be My disciple.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">For which of you, wanting to build a tower, does not first sit down and calculate the expense, whether he has enough to finish it?</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Otherwise, when he has laid a foundation and is unable to complete it, all who see it may begin to mock him,</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">saying, ‘This man began to build and was unable to finish.’</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Or what king, going to meet another king in war, will not first sit down and consider whether he is able with ten thousand to meet the one coming against him with twenty thousand?</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">And if not, while the other is still far away, he sends a delegation and asks for terms of peace.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">So, therefore, every one of you who does not renounce all his own possessions cannot be My disciple.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-14/#v14-26\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 14:26–33\">Luke 14:26–33</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-10/#v10-37\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 10:37\">Matthew 10:37</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k40\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k40\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>40.</strong> To seek first His kingdom and His righteousness.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">But seek first the kingdom of God and His righteousness, and all these things will be added to you.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-6/#v6-33\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 6:33\">Matthew 6:33</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-12/#v12-31\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 12:31\">Luke 12:31</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"saints-section\",\"anchor\":\"t2-3\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading saints-section\" id=\"t2-3\">Hear and Keep</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k41\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k41\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>41.</strong> To hear His words and do them, like the man who built upon the rock.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Therefore everyone who hears these words of Mine and puts them into practice will be likened to a prudent man who built his house upon the rock.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The rain came down, the rivers came, and the winds blew and fell upon that house, and it did not fall, for it had been founded upon the rock.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">And everyone who hears these words of Mine and does not put them into practice will be likened to a foolish man who built his house upon the sand.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">The rain came down, the rivers came, and the winds blew and struck that house, and it fell; and its fall was great.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-7/#v7-24\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 7:24–27\">Matthew 7:24–27</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-6/#v6-46\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 6:46–49\">Luke 6:46–49</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k42\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k42\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>42.</strong> If you love Me, you will keep My commandments.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“If you love Me, you will keep My commandments.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-14/#v14-15\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 14:15\">John 14:15</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-14/#v14-21\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 14:21\">John 14:21</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-14/#v14-23\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 14:23\">John 14:23</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-15/#v15-10\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 15:10\">John 15:10</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k43\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k43\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>43.</strong> To remain in Him and in His love.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Remain in Me, and I in you. Just as the branch cannot bear fruit from itself unless it remains in the vine, neither can you unless you remain in Me.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">I am the vine; you are the branches. The one who remains in Me, and I in him, bears much fruit, because apart from Me you can do nothing.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-15/#v15-4\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 15:4–5\">John 15:4–5</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-15/#v15-9\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 15:9\">John 15:9</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k44\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k44\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>44.</strong> To labor for the food that remains to eternal life.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Do not work for the food that perishes, but for the food that remains for eternal life, which the Son of Man will give you; for upon Him the Father, God, has set His seal.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-6/#v6-27\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 6:27\">John 6:27</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k45\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k45\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>45.</strong> To let your light shine before people, so that they glorify your Father.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">So let your light shine before people, that they may see your good works and glorify your Father who is in the heavens.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-5/#v5-16\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 5:16\">Matthew 5:16</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-wide\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-the-law-fulfilled/\">← The Law Fulfilled</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/#part-two\">The Commandments of Christ: all subjects</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-love-mercy-forgiveness/\">Love, Mercy and Forgiveness →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#8a8a8a\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#8a8a8a\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"14px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#8a8a8a;font-size:14px\">Saints Translation · The Commandments of Christ · gathered from His own words in the four Gospels; statements in our own words; passages quoted from the Saints Translation with His words in red · working draft awaiting specialist review.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
}
